// HEXA-0POD OP-74 · _moe_exp AGREEMENT + DETERMINISM oracle · NO `use`
//
// THE GAP (documented-but-UNlocked, the OP-72 class — the 3rd distinct exp):
//   moe_lib.hexa's `_moe_exp` (range-reduce x = n·ln2 + r, |r|≤ln2/2, then a
//   14-term Taylor e^r, then ×2ⁿ by repeated mul/div) carries an explicit
